	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tametsi ad te, doctissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, virum et de me et de ecclesiola nostra <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>optime meritum, non sepius scribam, quod nolim scilicet <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>te meis occupari nugis, tamen quum hic <persName ref="p3273">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Ulstetterus</persName>, sementarii nostrę reipublicę scholęque prefectus, gener <persName ref="p4744">Pauli Fagii</persName> sen<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ioris, petiturus esset <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>, volui scribere, ut <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illi esset occasio te adeundi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is referet, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nos hic diebus superioribus multorum invidia <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quieti spectatores pertulerimus inter tot armorum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>strepitus et bellatores classicum canentium.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Quantis enim calumniis et nos, ne dicam dei filium <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et sacrosanctum eius verbum adfecerint, incredibile <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>est dictu; at deus videbit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nunc vero exercitu <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName> ad <placeName>Luczelburgun</placeName> traiecto sedati et <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>utcunque vicini nostri tranquilliores compescunt labella.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Scribit <persName ref="p8374">Hedio</persName> superiori hebdomada arcem <placeName>Ro<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>denbach</placeName> non procul a <placeName>Luczelburgo</placeName>, quod est sub <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ditione marchionum <placeName ref="l2978">Badensium</placeName>, iuniorum adolescentum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Philiberti et <persName ref="p1227">Christophori</persName>, a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> vi occupatam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>indeque ingentem thesaurum spoliasse, <foreign xml:lang="de">ob treymal <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hunderttausent guldin,</foreign> exceptis poculis argenteis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et clenodiis; nam tota regio omnes suas <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>copias illuc ceu in quoddam asylum collocarunt etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Direptis vero omnibus arcem <persName>Vulcano</persName> sacrificans <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>penitus diruit etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Certe inscrutabilia sunt dei iuditia.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Tu ora pro nobis, ut in hisce turbinibus ecclesia <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Christi salva consistat ac tandem horribili hac tempesta<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>te sedata vitam in melius emendantes credamus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in filium dei.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta tuos domesticos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cum fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 6. iunii 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">T[<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>uus] ille <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName> senex.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximio viro pietate ac <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eruditione d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiaste <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> [ecclesie] fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
